title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: Paras_Fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: Paras_Fundraising_timer += 4; week_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
card-image: img/ blank
tags: Paras_party

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @increase_dues: Increase dues.
- @maintain_dues: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce_dues: Reduce dues.

@increase_dues
subtitle: [+ Paras_dues + 1 +] resources gained. [? if m_dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: Paras_dues += 1; Paras_resources += Paras_dues;
view-if: Paras_dues <= 1000

The dues have increased.

@maintain_dues
subtitle: [+ Paras_dues +] resources gained. [? if Paras_dues = 0 : So nothing got, I guess. ?]
on-arrival: Paras_resources += Paras_dues;

We maintain our current dues.
